// frames and fires when three quarters of the lit tiles darken
// together; dark hair, fur or clothes do not set it off. `regions`
// compares four fixed boxes (face, chest, two torso boxes) and
// fires when two of them darken together. `both` runs the two and
// fires when either does.
type BlackoutRecoveryDetection string

