	// |---|---|
	// | `portrait` | jpg, png or webp, up to 10 MB |
	// | `voice` | a 10 to 60 second recording: mp3, wav, m4a, aac, ogg, flac, opus or webm, up to 12 MB |
	// | `knowledge` | pdf, docx, doc, txt, md, html or csv up to 50 MB; audio or video up to 20 MB |
